1
00:00:00,759 --> 00:00:02,589
(Amy:)Well, I get why he's annoyed.

2
00:00:02,594 --> 00:00:05,294
(Sheldon:)Well, then you don't
understand what's happening.

3
00:00:05,297 --> 00:00:06,927
(Raj:)See...

4
00:00:06,932 --> 00:00:08,162
(Sheldon:)Leonard refused to participate

5
00:00:08,166 --> 00:00:10,536
(Sheldon:)in a mandatory quarterly
Roommate Agreement meeting.

6
00:00:10,535 --> 00:00:14,405
(Sheldon:)This is what a generation raised
on Bart Simpson looks like.

7
00:00:14,406 --> 00:00:16,176
You love The Simpsons.

8
00:00:16,174 --> 00:00:19,344
(Sheldon:)I love Lisa Simpson.

9
00:00:21,513 --> 00:00:23,343
(Amy:)Well, I know how he feels.

10
00:00:23,348 --> 00:00:25,618
(Amy:)I never enjoyed our
Relationship Agreement meetings.

11
00:00:25,617 --> 00:00:27,317
(gasps) Wait.

12
00:00:27,319 --> 00:00:28,419
(Sheldon:)You were pretending?

13
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,750
(Raj:)Sorry.

14
00:00:30,756 --> 00:00:32,356
No!

15
00:00:32,357 --> 00:00:34,957
(Sheldon:)I don't believe you.
I could tell.

16
00:00:40,098 --> 00:00:41,398
"Oh, Sheldon,

17
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,630
"I never thought

18
00:00:42,634 --> 00:00:44,004
"re-filing a matter

19
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:48,772
(Amy:)in a standing subcommittee
could be so fascinating."

20
00:00:50,609 --> 00:00:54,479
(Sheldon:)Hmm, what do you think?

21
00:00:54,479 --> 00:01:00,019
(Penny:)You don't know?

